            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Пассажир разговаривал по телефону в тамбуре. Passazhír razgovárival po telefónu v támbure. The passenger was talking on the phone in the vestibule."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Masculine. Also the small space inside the door of a building."
            }
          ]
        },
