          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "тамбур (támbur) is usually traced to French tambour 'a drum', which EtymDB traces to Arabic ṭunbūr; the sense of a small closed space came later. EtymDB does not list the Russian word."
