              "text": "предъявлять (predyavlyát) — \"to present (a ticket or a document)\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "В вагоне пассажиры предъявляют билеты и паспорта. V vagóne passazhíry predyavlyáyut biléty i pasportá. In the carriage the passengers present their tickets and passports."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Imperfective; perfective предъявить (предъявлю, предъявишь). Formal."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "предъявлять (predyavlyát) is built from пред- 'before' and являть 'to show': to put something before someone's eyes. EtymDB traces явить to Proto-Slavic aviti 'to make visible'."
            }
          ]
        },
